# Per-role default model (OpenRouter slug). seed-agent.sh reads this when neither
# --model nor AGENCY_MODEL is provided, so cost tiering is a property of the role,
# not a per-computer decision. A specific seed can still override with --model.
#
# Budget profile: beginner-friendly. High-frequency / low-judgment roles run on
# ultra-cheap Chinese flash models; specialist reasoning uses a cheap Chinese
# mid-tier; only the rare CEO decisions reach the Sonnet 4.6 ceiling.
#
# Prices below are per 1M tokens (in / out), from the OpenRouter model list.
# IMPORTANT — verify every slug against https://openrouter.ai/models before
# publishing; slugs and prices change as new generations ship.
#
# NOTE on the ceiling: "anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6" was NOT found in the
# OpenRouter list pulled on 2026-09-04 (only newer Anthropic models appeared).
# Confirm the exact slug resolves on OpenRouter. If it does not, either route the
# CEO through Anthropic direct instead of OpenRouter, or set the ceiling to the
# strongest cheap model below (deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro-0813).

# Ceiling: rare, heavy strategic judgment.        ~$3 / $15
ceo=anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6

# Sole dispatcher + provisioning: frequent, structured -> ultra cheap.  $0.03 / $0.13
project-manager=qwen/qwen3.7-flash
ops-provisioner=qwen/qwen3.7-flash

# Reading / reporting: cheap flash.               $0.065 / $0.18
researcher=deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731
accountant=deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731

# Code / reasoning: cheap Chinese mid-tier.       $1.12 / $3.35
developer=deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro-0813

# Content / marketing: cheap Chinese mid-tier.    $1.15 / $3.50
marketing=z-ai/glm-latest
content-creator=z-ai/glm-latest

# Fallback for any unseeded role.                 $0.065 / $0.18
default=deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731
